.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH maw-src-new 1  "maw-src-new " 
.SH NAME
maw\-src\-new \- write a srcpkgs/<name>/template, blank or drafted from nixpkgs or the aur, and open it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmaw src new\fR [\fB\-\-from\-nix\fR] [\fB\-\-from\-aur\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
write a srcpkgs/<name>/template, blank or drafted from nixpkgs or the aur, and open it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-nix\fR [\fI<ATTR>\fR]
draft it from a nixpkgs package; the attribute defaults to the name
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-aur\fR [\fI<PKG>\fR]
draft it from an aur package; the package defaults to the name
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>

